(MACRO Park)
(FRAME machine)
(UNITS mm)
(PARAM 1 x "Park X" length 0)
(PARAM 2 y "Park Y" length 0)
(Lifts Z to the top of travel - only ever up - then moves X and Y to the park position, both in machine coordinates.)
(Example macro of the lcnc-suite: edit it in the Macros tab or replace it.)
o<park> sub
  M73
  G21 G90
  ; a retract never lowers Z: #<_abs_z> is the frame a G53 Z word addresses
  o<park_lift> if [#<_abs_z> LT 0]
    G53 G0 Z0
  o<park_lift> endif
  G53 G0 X#1 Y#2
o<park> endsub
